  "question": {
    "text": "When a body slides down from rest along a smooth inclined plane making an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the horizontal, it takes time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;When the same body slides down from the rest along a rough inclined plane making the same angle and through the same distance, it takes time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is a constant greater than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The co-efficient of friction between the body and the rough plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>On smooth incline,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>On rough incline</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>T</mi><mrow><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></math></p><p>By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00</mn></math></p>",
